d tracking-wide uppercase text-teal-dark\">About us</p><h1 class=\"font-display font-extrabold text-4xl md:text-6xl text-ink mt-2 tracking-tight\">Neighborhood dentistry,<br class=\"hidden sm:block\"/> done properly.</h1></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 md:px-8 py-16 md:py-20\"><div class=\"relative rounded-tl-[3rem] rounded-br-[3rem] rounded-tr-2xl rounded-bl-2xl bg-sand p-8 md:p-12\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 200\" fill=\"none\" class=\"absolute -top-8 left-10 w-40 h-14 text-teal/30\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M0 20 C 150 180, 450 180, 600 20\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" pathLength=\"1\" stroke-dashoffset=\"0\" stroke-dasharray=\"0 1\" style=\"opacity:0\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-ink/80 leading-relaxed\">Mehran Dental Care is a local clinic in Latifabad, Hyderabad, offering general and cosmetic dental treatment — from routine cleanings and fillings to root canal treatment, dentures, and orthodontics — for patients of all ages.</p><p class=\"text-ink/80 leading-relaxed mt-4\">We keep two daily shifts so that patients with work or school schedules can still find a convenient time, and we handle appointment requests and questions directly over WhatsApp so getting in touch is simple.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5 mt-10\"><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-2xl border border-line p-6\"><div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-mint text-teal-dark flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-stethoscope w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 3H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4a6 6 0 0 0 12 0V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-1\"></path><path d=\"M8 15a6 6 0 0 0 12 0v-3\"></path><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><p class=\"font-display font-bold text-ink mt-4\">General dentistry</p><p class=\"text-sm text-ink/60 mt-2\">Checkups, cleanings, fillings, and everyday care.</p></div></div><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-2xl border border-line p-6\"><div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-mint text-teal-dark flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart-pulse w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 9.591-3.676.56.56 0 0 0 .818 0A5.49 5.49 0 0 1 22 9.5c0 2.29-1.5 4-3 5.5l-5.492 5.313a2 2 0 0 1-3 .019L5 15c-1.5-1.5-3-3.2-3-5.5\"></path><path d=\"M3.22 13H9.5l.5-1 2 4.5 2-7 1.5 3.5h5.27\"></path></svg></div><p class=\"font-display font-bold text-ink mt-4\">Restorative care</p><p class=\"text-sm text-ink/60 mt-2\">Crowns, dentures, root canal, and tooth replacement.</p></div></div><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-2xl border border-line p-6\"><div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-mint text-teal-dark flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z\"></path><path d=\"M20 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 4h-4\"></pa